Z||000005||stsmithgt||04-16-2001||01:14 PM||||I have one.  I got it through the dealership.  That sounds bad, but I've spent so much money buying parts, I get a deal.  I paid about 85.00 a few years ago and no shipping fees.  Every now and then rolling up the light covers gets in the way, but it's not a bad.<BR>  I just looked at Colgan's web page and it looks like it costs about 98.00.<BR>  Oops, I didn't look long enough to see if shipping was included or not.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>I happened to have my box under my work bench with the receipt.<P>Here's the address off my receipt:<P><B>Colgan Custom<BR>18475 Bandilier Circle<BR>Fountain Valley, CA 92708<BR>(714) 965-0575<BR></B><P>It looks like there was a middle man in the deal.  He might only do whole sales like to the dealerships, but who knows?<P>Ned R. Healy & Co, Inc.<BR>P.O. BOX 2120<BR>Huntingtion Beach, CA 92647<P>I think that's all the info. I have with me.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR><p>[This message has been edited by stsmithgt (edited 04-16-2001).]||||reg||6
